### Create Milk Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryCode": "MILK",
  "name": "Milk",
  "description": "Fresh dairy milk products"
}

### Create Fruits Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryCode": "FRUITS",
  "name": "Fruits",
  "description": "Fresh fruits and packaged fruit products"
}

### Create Bread Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryCode": "BREAD",
  "name": "Bread",
  "description": "Fresh and packaged bread"
}

### Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories

### Get Category By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1

### Update Category
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryCode": "MILK",
  "name": "Milk & Cream",
  "description": "Fresh milk, cream and related dairy products"
}

### Deactivate Category
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

### Reactivate Category
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": true
}

### Duplicate Category Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryCode": "MILK",
  "name": "Duplicate Milk",
  "description": "Testing duplicate prevention"
}